Developer Summit in Portland closes in two weeks (1st July).

  http://selinuxproject.org/page/Developer_Summit_2009/CFP

Even with the current economic downturn, it seems there will be a good 
representation of the SELinux and Linux security community at the 
co-located LinuxCon and Linux Plumbers Conferences:

  http://events.linuxfoundation.org/events/linuxcon
  http://linuxplumbersconf.org/2009/
  

